### 
# What went wrong?


I have a panel with the following Influx 1.8 query:
````
SELECT * from (
SELECT last("percent_packet_loss") as packetloss FROM "ping" WHERE ("bucket" = 'switches' ) AND $timeFilter
) where "packetloss" > 0
GROUP BY "name"
````

When using grafana 9.3, with STAT PANEL, it works fine. Currently returning "13".

I upgraded to grafana 9.5 and this query is now broken., It keeps oscilating the returned value. from 1, 3, 6, 8, every time the dashboard refreshes.

Downgreading to grafana 9.3 fixes the issue.



![image](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/assets/8555749/6b8757bc-a033-4d07-b5f2-93ec72cca940)


### 
# How do we reproduce it?


See explanation above

### 
# What Grafana version are you using?


v9.5.2

